 rice, semi-milled or wholly milled, whether or not polished or glazed: $0.9bn, growing 11%/yr","Fish; frozen, jack and horse mackerel (Trachurus spp.), excluding fillets, fish meat of 0304, and edible fish offal of subheadings 0303.91 to 0303.99: $0.3bn, growing 26%/yr","Cereals; rice, broken: $0.2bn, growing 11%/yr"]},{"headline":"Switzerland, Netherlands, Mali take 34% of exports","detail":"Export destinations are reasonably spread, which means established routes and documentation for several markets rather than just one.","angle":"partner","strength":"moderate","evidence":["Switzerland: 15.1% ($4.3bn)","Netherlands: 13.2% ($3.7bn)","Mali: 5.9% ($1.7bn)"]},{"headline":"Most imports arrive from China","detail":"China supplies 20% of what Cote d''Ivoire imports. If you are sourcing to sell here, that is your incumbent competition and the price you have to beat. If you are buying, those trade lanes already exist.","angle":"partner","strength":"moderate","evidence":["China: 20.0% ($3.8bn)","Nigeria: 10.4% ($1.9bn)","France: 6.7% ($1.2bn)"]},{"headline":"2025 trade surplus of $9.8bn","detail":"Cote d''Ivoire sells more than it buys. Surplus economies usually have foreign currency available, which makes getting paid and repatriating profit simpler.","angle":"risk","strength":"strong","evidence":["Exports $29.4bn vs imports $19.6bn in 2025","Exports moved 43.2% year on year"]},{"headline":"Early signal: reception apparatus for television, whether or not incorporating radio-broadcast receivers or sound or video recording or reproducing apparatus; incorporating a colour video display or screen","detail":"Not a headline product yet, but growing 826% a year. Categories that hold that rate tend to reprice the market before they show up in the top ten, which is the window where entry is cheapest.","angle":"timing","strength":"strong","evidence":["Machinery & electronics: growing 826% a year since 2022, now 0.26% of exports at rank 21. Largest counterpart across all exports is Switzerland. Growth is uneven, so treat the projection as directional."]}]','2026-09-06 01:53:56');
